{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminary, a balanced ARPG that can be played Solo, or with friends. Scope could grow if the Early Access does well and the community grows, but for Day 1 expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Forgiving Combat and straight forward game mechanics to bring newbies to the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No Fuss Drop In Drop Out Co-op Multiplayer, simple for friends and family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Same enjoyable experience whether played Solo or 3 player Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Continued Character progression across your solo game and friend's games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2km sq Openworld Map to explore with multiple modes of traversal (Larger Map Planned)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quick Swap Different weapon types for dynamic combat, Sword/Shield, Bow, Magic Staff to start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies to fight and camps / bases to destroy, Large towers to liberate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini Bosses and Main Boss fight to &quot;Beat the Game&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game can be replayed at harder difficulties to continue fun and progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA Studios build Openworld Action RPGs with 100s of employees and a budget of millions, and we are going to do it with just TWO of US! haha JK. Luminary was never meant to be the &quot;everything&quot; game. We have a very specific size and  features list we felt were missing from other games, that we can handle at this level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/52112048a6fd021532f77c0a0b732247.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A dense hand crafted world to explore, with a robust fun locomotion system that allows you to go anywhere.<br>Climb the tallest mountains, brave the deepest waters, glide to distant lands, with many hidden treasure to uncover   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/bc7986493e0a637a1656476ccb5bb082.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A real time skill based combat system, where you can switch between fighting styles at the press of a button. <br>Melee, Ranged, Magic, Blocking, Dodging, Enjoy! and swap to different weapons during fights to keep it dynamic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/4500e0664d8ead507388903f5b0f2375.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drop in Drop out, 3 players online, with a planned 2 player local couch co-op option. No Hassle and No Problems.  <br>The Character you\u2019ve been progressing in your Solo game, is the same one you will use and progress further in Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/f8c2c641183a0f36da17f04d66380b1f.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a simplified Character Creator to make your unique character from multiple fantasy races to truly stand out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/0f54ca1d8986faa1fe5505e152b5e539.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progression stays with you, from solo, to co-op and back through multiple playthroughs. And even your town upgrades go with you into New Game +. You will Unlock new Tier levels of difficulty every time you beat the maps end boss, and those higher Tiers are where the enemies are tougher but the rewards and XP are even greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/001dbbfe590ece90e0f3cb0bc6edd4fd.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There will be mining, fishing, animal catching, and other things to enjoy. And in Multiplayer you are not tied to your Host\u2019s location, you are free to play your way, even in their game. You can be the team\u2019s miner, searching for the best ores, and trade them to your friends for their precious GOLD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/dca0ca64270eab058f42d77865f57d6f.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the towns people and use gathered resources to help them rebuild to their former glory. <br>The Blacksmith, Armorer, Arcanist and Chef can level up as well, granting the ability to sell and craft better equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/582206d7e69f343912970de3b257fad9.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a primal magic surged from the earth's depths, fueling empires but twisting it's inhabitant and the world into corruption's grasp. Forests blackened, skies bled shadow, and rivers turned to poison. <br> <br>But a less prevalent radiant energy was also born, and hidden within pure warriors, the Luminaries. Armed with the light, their goal is to reclaim the land, hurling back the blight. <br> <br>Yet the Luminary's gift is double-edged,  immortality that tempts the soul. Every 80 years, Luminaries must yield their light to a successor, or risk eternal decay. Defiant ones hoard it, swelling into godlike tyrants of darkness, the Ebonarchs <br> <br>As a new Luminary, rise in power. Shatter the Ebonarch's abyssal power source to strip their immortality, and strike them down. Together with your fellow Luminaries, push back the Darkness with Light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1648360?t=1770760959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1648360?t=1770760959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/66a50b6322064d74e0dfaf7c35a6790ac9d7a65b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770760959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/66a50b6322064d74e0dfaf7c35a6790ac9d7a65b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770760959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4059020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminary, a balanced ARPG that can be played Solo, or with friends. Scope could grow if the Early Access does well and the community grows, but for Day 1 expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Forgiving Combat and straight forward game mechanics to bring newbies to the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No Fuss Drop In Drop Out Co-op Multiplayer, simple for friends and family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Same enjoyable experience whether played Solo or 3 player Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Continued Character progression across your solo game and friend's games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2km sq Openworld Map to explore with multiple modes of traversal (Larger Map Planned)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quick Swap Different weapon types for dynamic combat, Sword/Shield, Bow, Magic Staff to start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies to fight and camps / bases to destroy, Large towers to liberate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini Bosses and Main Boss fight to &quot;Beat the Game&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game can be replayed at harder difficulties to continue fun and progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA Studios build Openworld Action RPGs with 100s of employees and a budget of millions, and we are going to do it with just TWO of US! haha JK. Luminary was never meant to be the &quot;everything&quot; game. We have a very specific size and  features list we felt were missing from other games, that we can handle at this level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/52112048a6fd021532f77c0a0b732247.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/055bb24db2b428118ec840146eef20ff.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A dense hand crafted world to explore, with a robust fun locomotion system that allows you to go anywhere.<br>Climb the tallest mountains, brave the deepest waters, glide to distant lands, with many hidden treasure to uncover   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/bc7986493e0a637a1656476ccb5bb082.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/8b6e07fb43773e13d56fca77cfcc1f9e.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A real time skill based combat system, where you can switch between fighting styles at the press of a button. <br>Melee, Ranged, Magic, Blocking, Dodging, Enjoy! and swap to different weapons during fights to keep it dynamic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/4500e0664d8ead507388903f5b0f2375.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/23de69e951f574530dc7caa6a2e52e60.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drop in Drop out, 3 players online, with a planned 2 player local couch co-op option. No Hassle and No Problems.  <br>The Character you\u2019ve been progressing in your Solo game, is the same one you will use and progress further in Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/f8c2c641183a0f36da17f04d66380b1f.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/90ef5cfd8e017ffb442ee6c03e1e4226.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a simplified Character Creator to make your unique character from multiple fantasy races to truly stand out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/0f54ca1d8986faa1fe5505e152b5e539.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/38eba2e176f4128413e77011e7d00cfb.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progression stays with you, from solo, to co-op and back through multiple playthroughs. And even your town upgrades go with you into New Game +. You will Unlock new Tier levels of difficulty every time you beat the maps end boss, and those higher Tiers are where the enemies are tougher but the rewards and XP are even greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/001dbbfe590ece90e0f3cb0bc6edd4fd.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/691da003bf92410c57ca4dd4036e422f.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There will be mining, fishing, animal catching, and other things to enjoy. And in Multiplayer you are not tied to your Host\u2019s location, you are free to play your way, even in their game. You can be the team\u2019s miner, searching for the best ores, and trade them to your friends for their precious GOLD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/dca0ca64270eab058f42d77865f57d6f.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/7c598fe303d666b43af3442084a190cd.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the towns people and use gathered resources to help them rebuild to their former glory. <br>The Blacksmith, Armorer, Arcanist and Chef can level up as well, granting the ability to sell and craft better equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/582206d7e69f343912970de3b257fad9.webp?t=1770760959\" width=500 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fc227bfddc02abce359c1928353f990d.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a primal magic surged from the earth's depths, fueling empires but twisting it's inhabitant and the world into corruption's grasp. Forests blackened, skies bled shadow, and rivers turned to poison. <br> <br>But a less prevalent radiant energy was also born, and hidden within pure warriors, the Luminaries. Armed with the light, their goal is to reclaim the land, hurling back the blight. <br> <br>Yet the Luminary's gift is double-edged,  immortality that tempts the soul. Every 80 years, Luminaries must yield their light to a successor, or risk eternal decay. Defiant ones hoard it, swelling into godlike tyrants of darkness, the Ebonarchs <br> <br>As a new Luminary, rise in power. Shatter the Ebonarch's abyssal power source to strip their immortality, and strike them down. Together with your fellow Luminaries, push back the Darkness with Light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.poster.avif?t=1770760959\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.webm?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.mp4?t=1770760959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Refractive Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/3d8b05a75a68e08c9d1584d5cce625b04cd7df35/header.jpg?t=1770760959","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Luminary and all media shown is owned by Refractive Entertai